n data-astro-cid-pzodn2xh=\"\">]</span></code></p></div><figcaption data-astro-cid-pzodn2xh=\"\">The type Parser of T is a function from an input string to a pair of a T and the rest of the string. For example, pInteger cuts \"10 20 30\" after\"10\", and returns the number 10 and the rest of the string,\" 20 30\".</figcaption></figure></div><div data-viz-phase=\"chain\" data-viz-active=\"false\" inert=\"\" data-astro-cid-5cgxuhsa=\"\"><figure data-parser-chain=\"\" data-hold-ms=\"5000\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><div data-plate=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><p><code data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">pHello</code><code data-strip=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">Hello</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">, </span><span data-rest=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"> 100</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">]</span></code></p><p><code data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">pIgnoreWhitespace</code><code data-strip=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"> </span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">null</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">, </span><span data-rest=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">100</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">]</span></code></p><p><code data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">pInteger</code><code data-strip=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">100</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">, </span><span data-rest=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">]</span></code></p></div><figcaption data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"Hello 100\" parsed by pHello, then pIgnoreWhitespace, then pInteger, each taking the rest the one before left over: pHello returns \"Hello\" and \" 100\". pIgnoreWhitespace returns \" \" and \"100\". pInteger returns \"100\" and \"\".</figcaption></figure></div><div data-viz-phase=\"chain-one\" data-viz-active=\"false\" inert=\"\" data-astro-cid-5cgxuhsa=\"\"><figure data-parser-chain=\"\" data-hold-ms=\"5000\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><div data-plate=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><p><code data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">pHello100</code><code data-strip=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">Hello 100</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[\"Hello\", null, 100]</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">, </span><span data-rest=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">]</span></code></p></div><figcaption data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"Hello 100\" parsed by pHello100, each taking the rest the one before left over: pHello100 returns \"Hello 100\" and \"\".</figcaption></figure></div><div data-astro-cid-5cgxuhsa=\"\" inert=\"\" data-viz-active=\"false\" data-viz-phase=\"seq-type\" data-astro-cid-xrb3j3tt=\"\"><