span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">]</span></code></p><p><code data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">pSeq(pNumber, pSemicolon)</code><code data-strip=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">20;</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[20, \";\"]</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">, </span><span data-rest=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">30;</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">]</span></code></p><p><code data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">pSeq(pNumber, pSemicolon)</code><code data-strip=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">30;</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">[30, \";\"]</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">, </span><span data-rest=\"\" data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\"></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"</span></span><span data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">]</span></code></p></div><figcaption data-astro-cid-rvhuomkz=\"\">\"10;20;30;\" parsed by pSeq(pNumber, pSemicolon), then pSeq(pNumber, pSemicolon), then pSeq(pNumber, pSemicolon), each taking the rest the one before left over: pSeq(pNumber, pSemicolon) returns \"10;\" and \"20;30;\". pSeq(pNumber, pSemicolon) returns \"20;\" and \"30;\". pSeq(pNumber, pSemicolon) returns \"30;\" and \"\".</figcaption></figure></div><div data-viz-phase=\"ping\" data-viz-active=\"false\" inert=\"\" data-astro-cid-5cgxuhsa=\"\"><figure data-astro-cid-fvksbjds=\"\"><p><code data-astro-cid-fvksbjds=\"\">PING 1.1.1.1 